Travis Gafford: "What really defines Dardoch?"

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:21.680
"Um I'm just a dumb 17-year-old kid who played too much solo queue and got lucky."

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.180
What's up guys, my name is Colin McNeil for theScore esports.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:30.780
Dardoch is a name that comes
with some baggage. His attitude is

00:00:30.789 --> 00:00:35.079
confident to the point of being cocky.
But if you're gonna talk a big game you

00:00:35.079 --> 00:00:39.730
better be willing to back it up on the
Rift and Dardoch has no trouble doing

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:45.130
just that. So while he's killing it with
his new team in the spring split, we

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:49.480
thought it would be the perfect time to
bring you the best of Dardoch.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:02:11.840
[Casting

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:16.320
