Dardoch: "Yeah, pretty much I wanted to make Worlds and Immortals didn't really care too much about it.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.080
So I wanted to join a team that would get me there."

00:03:53.600 --> 00:04:43.840
[Casting]

